    <description>When a Campaign is created with Department&quot; Marketing&quot; ,then a new related &quot;Campaign Member status&quot; records need to be created.
Campaign Status = Active then when a record is created, and any time it&apos;s edited to subsequently meet criteria the &quot;Active&quot; checkbox should be checked to TRUE.</description>
    <environments>Default</environments>
    <formulas>
        <description>Formula to get &quot;Has Responded&quot; Value (True / False) to be assigned to the current record</description>
        <name>HasRespondedValue</name>
        <dataType>Boolean</dataType>
        <expression>IF({!Member_Status_Loop} = &apos;Sent Email&apos; || {!Member_Status_Loop} =&apos;Campaign Member&apos; , false, true)</expression>
    </formulas>
    <formulas>
